{"ticker":"CPRT","updated":"2026-10-30T22:41:56Z","profile":{"longName":"Copart, Inc.","shortName":"Copart, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.copart.com","fullTimeEmployees":21000,"marketCap":27910334464,"trailingPE":19.43871,"forwardPE":16.646408,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.981373,"pegRatio":2.96,"targetMeanPrice":39.0,"targetHighPrice":55.0,"targetLowPrice":25.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.024,"earningsGrowth":-0.15,"grossMargins":0.45291,"operatingMargins":0.32011002,"profitMargins":0.31809,"totalRevenue":4666208768,"beta":1.058,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":43.38,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":25.72,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Copart, Inc. provides online auctions and vehicle remarketing services in the United States, the United Kingdom, Germany, Brazil, Canada, the United Arab Emirates, Spain, Finland, Oman, the Republic of Ireland, and Bahrain. The company provides a range of services to process and sell vehicles over the internet through its virtual bidding third generation internet auction-style sales technology. It offers services, such as online seller access; salvage estimation; estimating; end-of-life vehicle processing; transportation; vehicle inspection stations; on-demand reporting; title processing and express; loan payoff; flexible vehicle processing programs; buy it now and make an offer; sales process; and dealer services. In addition, the company provides IntelliSeller, an automated tool that leverages its vehicle and sales data to assist its sellers in making vital auction decisions; BluCar to sell vehicles of financial institutions, fleet, and rental car companies; CashForCars.com, CashForCars.ca, CashForCars.de, CashForCars.co.uk, and Cash-for-cars.ie; and national powersport auctions services, which include services through live and online auction platforms to dealers, financial institutions, and original equipment manufacturers. Further, it offers wholesale construction, agriculture, and fleet remarketing services through no-reserve online auctions under Purple Wave brand name; C","summary_zh":"Copart, Inc. 在美國、英國、德國、巴西、加拿大、阿拉伯聯合大公國、西班牙、芬蘭、阿曼、愛爾蘭共和國和巴林提供線上拍賣和車輛再行銷服務。該公司透過其虛擬投標第三代網路拍賣式銷售技術，提供一系列在網路上處理和銷售車輛的服務。它提供服務，例如線上賣家訪問；殘值估算；估計；報廢車輛處理；運輸;車輛檢驗站；按需報告；產權處理及快遞；還清貸款；靈活的車輛加工方案；立即購買並報價；銷售流程；和經銷商服務。此外，該公司還提供 IntelliSeller，這是一種自動化工具，可利用其車輛和銷售數據協助賣家做出重要的拍賣決策； BluCar 出售金融機構、車隊和租車公司的車輛； CashForCars.com、CashForCars.ca、CashForCars.de、CashForCars.co.uk 和 Cash-for-cars.ie-for-cars.此外，它還透過 Purple Wave 品牌下的無保留線上拍賣提供批發建築、農業和車隊再行銷服務； C","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"專業商業服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":48.61,"h":49.12,"l":48.04,"c":48.48,"v":8264900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":48.38,"h":48.59,"l":47.81,"c":48.12,"v":6428300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":49.03,"h":50.11,"l":48.6,"c":49.97,"v":8687600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":48.76,"h":48.88,"l":46.14,"c":48.57,"v":17584700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":48.67,"h":49.16,"l":47.37,"c":48.75,"v":12159300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":48.54,"h":49.11,"l":47.93,"c":48.07,"v":6642200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":47.9,"h":48.61,"l":47.69,"c":48.52,"v":5367000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":48.57,"h":49.05,"l":48.23,"c":48.9,"v":5234900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":48.63,"h":48.96,"l":48.38,"c":48.4,"v":3944900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":48.68,"h":48.77,"l":47.38,"c":47.6,"v":5947200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":47.53,"h":47.63,"l":46.32,"c":46.57,"v":11061400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":47.21,"h":47.56,"l":46.53,"c":46.62,"v":6038400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":46.9,"h":47.0,"l":45.37,"c":45.46,"v":11982600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":45.42,"h":46.21,"l":45.27,"c":45.85,"v":20164400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":45.48,"h":45.95,"l":45.21,"c":45.38,"v":7144200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":45.26,"h":45.66,"l":44.95,"c":45.28,"v":9943100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":45.2,"h":45.64,"l":45.06,"c":45.39,"v":6860900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":45.31,"h":45.35,"l":44.67,"c":44.89,"v":6877100},{"t":"2025-09-2