 19 億美元收購"},{"title":"Copart (CPRT) Clears A Key Deal Hurdle, Is It Still A Bargain?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPS1NRTE1HeW04QmJoY1c0NFJ4dEJobTJtUFUxTVN2a2xOU3o0TDVJdjlONmFNVGh1ZTFGVGZzaUJfX0t6ajRlT2pQZHpaTHNjdlBUeUhQSlVmRlFEbWtEcE5ySVZuYVFGekYyb2d2RG00ZjhnT3JxUU5uMnZkR0ZtSW04LVFSSjhVSWtwSXViLUEtZW9YbHRN?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"Copart (CPRT) 清除了一個關鍵的交易障礙，它仍然是便宜貨嗎？"}],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":6},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-09-29","period":"2026-07-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/900075/000119312526405731/cprt-20260731.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Copart , BID4U , CI & Design , DRIVE Auto Auctions , 1-800 CAR BUYER , CA$HFORCARS.COM , COPART & DESIGN , VB3 & DESIGN , VB3 , National Powersports Auctions , NPA , Purple Wave Auction , and CrashedToys.com are trademarks of Copart, Inc. or one of its direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiaries. This Form 10-K also includes other trademarks of Copart and of other companies.","zh":"Copart 、 BID4U 、 CI & Design 、 DRIVE Auto Auctions 、 1-800 CAR BUYER 、 CA$HFORCARS.COM 、 COPART & DESIGN 、 VB3 & DESIGN 、 VB3 、 National Powersports Auctions 、 NPA 、 Purple Waveauction 和 VB3 、 National Powersports Auctions 、 NPA 、 Purple WaveAuction 和直接子公司 Crash.com 的子公司之一。此表格 10-K 还包括 Copart 和其他公司的其他商标。"},{"en":"We are a leading global provider of online auctions and vehicle remarketing services with operations in the United States (\"U.S.\"), the United Kingdom (\"U.K.\"), Germany, Brazil, Canada, the United Arab Emirates (\"U.A.E.\"), Spain, Finland, Oman, the Republic of Ireland, and Bahrain.","zh":"我們是全球領先的線上拍賣和車輛再行銷服務供應商，業務遍及美國（「美國」）、英國（「英國」）、德國、巴西、加拿大、阿拉伯聯合大公國（「阿聯酋」）、西班牙、芬蘭、阿曼、愛爾蘭共和國和巴林。"},{"en":"Our goals are to generate sustainable profits for our stockholders, while also providing environmental and social benefits for the world around us. With respect to our environmental stewardship, we believe our business is a critical enabler for the global re-use and recycling of vehicles, parts, and raw materials. We are not responsible for the carbon emissions resulting from new vehicle manufacturing, governmental fuel emissions standards or vehicle use by consumers. Each vehicle that enters our business operations already exists, with whatever fuel technology and efficiency it was designed and built to have, and the substantial carbon emissions associated with the vehicle's manufacture have already occurred. However, upon our receipt of an existing vehicle, we help facilitate the decrease of its total environmental impact by extending its useful life and thereby avoiding the carbon emi","zh":"我們的目標是為股東創造可持續的利潤，同時為我們周圍的世界提供環境和社會效益。在我們的環境管理方面，我們相信我們的業務是全球車輛、零件和原材料再利用和回收的關鍵推動者。我們不對新車製造、政府燃油排放標準或消費者使用車輛所產生的碳排放負責。每輛進入我們業務運營的車輛都已經存在，無論其設計和製造的燃料技術和效率如何，並且與車輛製造相關的大量碳排放已經發生。然而，在我們收到現有車輛後，我們會透過延長其使用壽命來幫助減少其整體環境影響，從而避免碳排放"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our U.S. and International regions are considered two separate operating segments and are disclosed as two reportable segments. The segments represent geographic areas and reflect how the chief operating decision maker, or \"CODM\", the","zh":"我們的美國和國際區域被視為兩個獨立的營運分部，並作為兩個可報告分部進行揭露。这些细分代表地理区域并反映首席运营决策者（CODM）如何"},{"en":"Company's Chief Executive Officer, allocates resources and measures results. The Company's CODM evaluates the performance of its reportable segments and allocates resources based on segment Operating Income. This measure is used to assess profitability, guide decisions regarding capital investment, and evaluate the performance of segment leadership. For the year ended July 31, 2026, we generated 81.6 % of our revenue in our U.S. segment and 18.4 % in our international segment. Geographic information as well as comparative segment revenues and related financial information pertaining to the U.S. and International segments for the years ended July 31, 2026, 2025 and 2024 are presented in the tables in NOTE 14 — Segments and Other Geographic Reporting, to the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements, which are included elsewhere in this Form 10-K.","zh":"公司執行長分配資源並衡量結果。本公司主要的經營決策者評估其可報告分部的績效並根據分部營業收入分配資源。此指標用於評估獲利能力、指導資本投資決策以及評估細分市場領導者的績效。截至 2026 年 7 月 31 日的年度，我們 81.6% 的營收來自美國業務，18.4% 來自國際業務。截至 2026 年 7 月 31 日、2025 年和 2024 年的年度的地理資訊以及比較部門收入和與美國和國際部門相關的財務資訊均列於合併財務報表附註的附註 14 — 部門和其他地理報告中的表格中，這些資訊包含在本表格 10-K 的其他部分中。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We process vehicles from hundreds of different vehicle sellers. No single customer accounted for more than 10% of our consolidated revenues for fiscal 2026, 2025, or 2024 and our business does not depend on any particular customer to remain profitable. We obtained 79%, 81%, and 81% of the total number of vehicles processed during fiscal 2026, 2025, or 2024, respectively, from insurance company sellers.","zh":"我们处理来自数百家不同车辆卖家的车辆。沒有任何一個客戶占我們 2026、2025 或 2024 財年合併收入的 10% 以上，而且我們的業務不依賴任何特定客戶來保持盈利。我们从保险公司卖家处分别获得了 2026、2025 和 2024 财年处理的车辆总数的 79%、81% 和 81%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We face significant competition from other remarketers of both salvage and non-salvage vehicles. Against these other vehicle remarketers, we face competition for long-term contractual commitments and various supply agreements with sellers, in addition to competition for the acquisition of vehicle storage facilities. We believe our principal competitors include vehicle auction and sales companies and vehicle dismantlers. These national, regional, and local competitors may have established relationships with vehicle sellers and buyers and may have financial resources that are greater than ours. The largest national or regional vehicle auctioneers in the U.S. include RB Global (including its subsidiary Insurance Auto Auctions, Inc.), Carvana, Openlane, Manheim, Inc. and ACV Auctions Inc. The largest national dismantler in the U.S. is LKQ Corporation (\"LKQ\"). LKQ, in addition to trade groups","zh":"我們面臨其他報廢和非報廢車輛再行銷商的激烈競爭。與其他車輛再行銷商相比，除了收購車輛儲存設施的競爭外，我們還面臨與賣方的長期合約承諾和各種供應協議的競爭。我們認為我們的主要競爭對手包括汽車拍賣和銷售公司以及汽車拆解商。這些國家、地區和當地的競爭對手可能已經與汽車銷售商和購買者建立了關係，並且可能擁有比我們更多的財務資源。美國最大的全國性或地區性汽車拍賣商包括 RB Global（包括其子公司 Insurance Auto Auctions, Inc.）、Carvana、Openlane、Manheim, Inc. 和 ACV Auctions Inc.。美國最大的全國性拆解商是 LKQ Corporation（「LKQ」）。 LKQ，除了貿易團體"},{"en":"Our primary management information system runs on a platform called G2, an integrated mesh of proprietary, distributed systems that is based on services architecture and open standards. A portion of the functionality still resides in the legacy system called CAS.","zh":"我們的主要管理資訊系統運行在名為 G2 的平台上，這是一個基於服務架構和開放標準的專有分散式系統的整合網格。部分功能仍然驻留在称为 CAS 的遗留系统中。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-07-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":3969520000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Product","val":696689000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":4666209000}},"peers":["VRSK","CTAS","ODFL","IDXX","ORLY"]}}